# large-prompt-regression
owner: teknium · cadence: once per server config change · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a loop that replays progressively larger prompts against your local servers to catch SIGKILL or cache failures before you do?**

## Prompt
Send probe prompts of increasing token length to each local inference endpoint; record exit codes and cache stats; flag kills over 10k tokens.

## Evidence
> proc_6601b0a4a07e exited (exit code -9) while handling a prompt of 40011 tokens.
> Prompt Cache: 8 sequences, 1.56 GB
